      "content": "It's a very painful thought, but you're not just taking up space; you are a complete, complex person, and your existence has inherent value, even if you can't feel it right now. The exhaustion you see in her is a reflection of the pressure, not a measure of your worth. If you're truly feeling like you're a drain, perhaps the most selfless thing you could do is to take a small step toward finding a way to make that weight lighter for both of you.",
